# Arcturus spell-kit ship checklist

Use this whenever you add or change **custom spell mechanics** that attach to existing abilities (procs, brands, redirects, DE hooks, pet bar spells, stance swaps).

## Before calling the work done

1. **List every player/pet-facing spell that applies or is modified by the new effect**
   - New IDs (buffs, debuffs, toggles, helpers)
   - **All stock ranks** that gain scripts / new behavior (e.g. every Cleave + Intercept rank)
   - Parent / related UI spells (e.g. Demonic Empowerment when DE also grants Mandate)
2. **Update client text** in live `C:\Games\WoW Spell Editor\SpellEditor.db`:
   - `SpellDescription0` = spellbook / cast tooltip
   - `SpellToolTip0` = **buff/debuff mouseover** (required for visible auras — empty tip looks like “does nothing”)
   - Prefer `WoW-Spell-Editor/Arcturus/apply_*_tooltips.py` and **run it**
3. **Mirror** Description + AuraDescription in pending `spell_dbc` for custom IDs
4. **Tell the user**: reopen Spell Editor → Export `Spell.dbc` (± `OverrideSpellData.dbc`) → MPQ → clear `Cache/WDB`

## Do not

- Ship scripts/SQL that apply Brand / redirects / Mandate / etc. while Cleave/Intercept/Felstorm/DE still have stock text
- Update only Rank 1 or only the new custom ID
- Fill Description but leave **SpellToolTip0 empty** on a visible buff/debuff
- Rely on server `spell_dbc` alone for what the player reads on the client

## Quick fan-out pattern (Mandate lesson)

| New effect | Also update Description + ToolTip on |
|------------|--------------------------------------|
| Brand from Cleave / Felstorm / Intercept | All Cleave ranks, all Intercept ranks, Felstorm, Brand passive, **Brand debuff (ToolTip!)** |
| DE grants Mandate | DE player spell + Felguard DE buff + Mandate buff (ToolTip) |
| Shade openers remap bar | Stance toggle + each opener + amp/silence helper debuffs (ToolTip) |

**Concise stock text:** Cleave / Intercept / Felstorm / DE say “Applies Legion Brand” / “grants Mandate” — put full Brand numbers on the Brand passive + debuff only.

